void f(int n) {
    if (n > 0) f(n-1);
    g();
}
main() { f(3); }
```

What is the maximum number of activation records on the stack at any instant, including the record for `main`?

```c
int f(int &x, int c) {      // x by reference, c by value
    c = c - 1;
    if (c == 0) return 1;
    x = x + 1;
    int r = f(x, c);
    return r * x;
}
```

